===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*sed-}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|сало}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*sadlo}}.

For {{m|ru|сиде́ть}} relation, compare typologically {{m+|grc|στέαρ}} (whence {{m|ru|стеари́н}}, {{m|ru|стеато-}}) << {{m+|ine-pro|*steh₂-}}.

